        "Description": "Good Evening, 47.\r\rThe trail has finally led to the Mastermind: Terrence Jones.\r\rJones was our anonymous client from the start. Using the Agency to silence Potts and innocent Perry, desperately covering his tracks while orchestrating a fraudulent merger between Tomas Cross and a compromised London newspaper company. Jones smuggled insider assets off-grid, intending to short the stock and reap millions as the company collapsed.\r\rCross&apos;s Board wants us to kill Jones.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
